<title>USA: Luby's Cafeteria names its president CEO.</title>
<headline>Luby's Cafeteria names its president CEO.</headline>
<dateline>SAN ANTONIO 1997-01-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Luby's Cafeterias Inc said on Tuesday that the company's president, John Curtis Jr, has been named chief executive officer.</p>
<p>Chairman Ralph Erben was previously also CEO. He would remain chairman, the company said.</p>
<p>((New York newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
</text>
